{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Vidgo API - Generate Music API",
    "description": "AI 音乐生成，可自定义风格和人声",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.vidgo.ai",
      "description": "生产环境"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "BearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/generate/submit": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "提交音乐生成任务",
        "description": "使用 AI 模型生成带人声或不带人声的音乐",
        "operationId": "submitMusicTask",
        "tags": ["Music Generation"],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "custom-mode": {
                  "summary": "自定义模式 - 完全控制",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "generate-music",
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/callback",
                    "input": {
                      "prompt": "A calm and relaxing piano track with soft melodies",
                      "style": "Classical",
                      "title": "宁静钢琴冥想",
                      "custom_mode": true,
                      "instrumental": true,
                      "mv": "V5",
                      "negative_tags": "Heavy Metal, Upbeat Drums",
                      "style_weight": 0.65
                    }
                  }
                },
                "simple-mode": {
                  "summary": "简单模式 - 仅歌词",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "generate-music",
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/callback",
                    "input": {
                      "prompt": "Write a song about summer love and beach sunsets",
                      "custom_mode": false,
                      "instrumental": false,
                      "mv": "V4"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "instrumental": {
                  "summary": "纯音乐",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "generate-music",
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/callback",
                    "input": {
                      "prompt": "Epic orchestral soundtrack for a fantasy adventure",
                      "style": "Cinematic, Orchestral",
                      "title": "巨龙之旅",
                      "custom_mode": true,
                      "instrumental": true,
                      "mv": "V4_5PLUS"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务提交成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "API Key",
        "description": "所有 API 接口都需要 Bearer Token 认证\n\n获取 API Key：\n\n进入 **仪表盘 → API 密钥**（[API Key 管理页面](https://vidgo.ai/apis/dashboard/api-key)）获取你的 API Key\n\n在请求头中添加：\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer VIDGO_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "SubmitRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["model", "input"],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "generate-music"
          },
          "callback_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "接收结果通知的 Webhook 回调 URL",
            "example": "https://your-domain.com/callback"
          },
          "input": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["prompt", "custom_mode", "instrumental", "mv"],
            "description": "音乐生成的输入参数",
            "properties": {
              "prompt": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "对期望音频内容的描述。\n\n- 自定义模式（`custom_mode: true`）：`instrumental` 为 `false` 时必填。prompt 会严格作为歌词，在生成的曲目中演唱。\n  各模型字符上限：\n  - **V4**：最多 3000 个字符\n  - **V4_5 & V4_5PLUS**：最多 5000 个字符\n  - **V4_5ALL**：最多 5000 个字符\n  - **V5**：最多 5000 个字符\n\n- 非自定义模式（`custom_mode: false`）：始终必填。prompt 作为核心创意，歌词会据此自动生成（不严格匹配输入）。最多 500 个字符。\n  示例：\"A short relaxing piano tune\"",
                "maxLength": 5000,
                "example": "A calm and relaxing piano track with soft melodies"
              },
              "custom_mode": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "启用高级参数自定义模式。\n\n- 为 `true` 时：可完全控制风格、标题和其他参数。`style` 和 `title` 变为必填字段。\n\n- 为 `false` 时：简化模式，只需 `prompt`。歌词会根据提示词自动生成。",
                "example": true
              },
              "instrumental": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "指定是否生成不带人声的纯音乐。\n\n- 为 `true` 时：生成不含任何人声的纯音乐，只需 `style` 和 `title`。\n\n- 为 `false` 时：`style`、`prompt` 和 `title` 必填。",
                "example": true
              },
              "style": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "音乐风格说明，用于定义流派、情绪或艺术方向。\n\n`custom_mode` 为 `true` 时必填。\n\n各模型字符上限：\n- **V4**：最多 200 个字符\n- **V4_5 & V4_5PLUS**：最多 1000 个字符\n- **V4_5ALL**：最多 1000 个字符\n- **V5**：最多 1000 个字符",
                "maxLength": 1000,
                "example": "Classical"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "在播放器中显示并用于文件命名的曲目标题。\n\n`custom_mode` 为 `true` 时必填。\n\n最多 80 个字符。",
                "maxLength": 80,
                "example": "Peaceful Piano Meditation"
              },
              "mv": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "用于音乐生成的 AI 模型版本。\n\n- **V5**：音乐表现力更出色，生成更快。\n- **V4_5PLUS**：音色更丰富，创作方式更多，最长 8 分钟。\n- **V4_5**：提示词理解更智能，生成更快，最长 8 分钟。\n- **V4_5ALL**：提示词理解更智能，生成更快，最长 8 分钟。\n- **V4**：人声质量提升，最长 4 分钟。",
                "enum": ["V4", "V4_5", "V4_5ALL", "V4_5PLUS", "V5"],
                "example": "V5"
              },
              "negative_tags": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "生成时要排除的音乐风格或特征。\n\n指定输出中要避免的曲风、情绪或乐器。",
                "example": "Heavy Metal, Upbeat Drums"
              },
              "vocal_gender": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "生成音乐的首选人声性别。\n\n- `m`：男声\n- `f`：女声\n\n仅在 `custom_mode` 为 `true` 且 `instrumental` 为 `false` 时生效。\n\n**注意**：此参数只能提高指定性别的概率，不能保证。",
                "enum": ["m", "f"],
                "example": "m"
              },
              "style_weight": {
                "type": "number",
                "description": "控制指定风格对生成结果的影响强度。\n\n取值范围：0-1，最多 2 位小数。\n\n值越高，越贴合指定风格。",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 1,
                "example": 0.65
              },
              "weirdness_constraint": {
                "type": "number",
                "description": "控制实验性创意和非常规元素的程度。\n\n取值范围：0-1，最多 2 位小数。\n\n- 值较低：音乐更常规\n- 值较高：输出更具实验性和独特性",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 1,
                "example": 0.65
              },
              "audio_weight": {
                "type": "number",
                "description": "在音频特性与其他生成因素之间取得平衡。\n\n取值范围：0-1，最多 2 位小数。\n\n调整最终输出中对音质和声音特征的侧重。",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 1,
                "example": 0.65
              },
              "persona_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "应用于生成音乐的 Persona ID。\n\n用于为音乐生成应用特定的 Persona 风格。Persona ID 通过 Persona 创建接口获取。\n\n仅在启用自定义模式时可用。\n\n如何生成 persona_id，请参阅 [generate-persona](/zh/api-manual/music-series/generate-persona)。",
                "example": "persona_123"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "SubmitResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["code", "data"],
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 200,
            "description": "HTTP 状态码"
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["task_id", "status", "created_time"],
            "properties": {
              "task_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "task-unified-1757165031-uyujaw3d",
                "description": "任务唯一标识，用于查询任务状态"
              },
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["not_started"],
                "example": "not_started",
                "description": "初始任务状态"
              },
              "created_time": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time",
                "example": "2025-11-12T10:30:00",
                "description": "任务创建时间，ISO 8601 格式"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["code", "error"],
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 400,
            "description": "HTTP 状态码"
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["message", "type"],
            "properties": {
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "Invalid request parameters",
                "description": "描述错误原因的错误信息"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "invalid_request_error",
                "description": "错误类型标识"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
